content.scopeOfRegistration:
The scope of the HDS Certification is limited to the processing of personal health data as included in the ISMS/ISO 27001:2022 scope that applies to Microsoft and the datacenters located within the European Economic Area (EEA), and centralized operations for the provision of Microsoft Infrastructure, Platform and Software services covered by the ISMS/ISO 27001:2022 certification, when such services are used for processing, outsourcing, and backup services that relate to personal health data including their development, operations, and infrastructure and their associated security, privacy, and compliance, and inclusive of the requirements from the HDS Referential Version 2.0, and in accordance with the Statement of Applicability Version 2026.01, dated July 31, 2026, for the following activities:
-	The provision and maintenance in operational condition of physical sites for hosting the hardware infrastructure of the information system used to process the health data;
-	The provision and maintenance in operational condition of the hardware infrastructure of the information system used to process the health data;
-	The provision and maintenance in operational condition of the virtual infrastructure of the information system used to process the health data;
-	The provision and maintenance in operational condition of the platform for hosting information system applications; and
-	Backing up health data.
